OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain or showers, some of which could
OL,8,Fbe heavy at times. Likely becoming
OL,9,Fdrier towards dawn with some clear
OL,10,Fspells developing. Less cold than last
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA dry and bright start across
OL,14,Fthe region with sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Tending to cloud over a
OL,16,Flittle through the afternoon,
OL,17,Fespecially in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
